  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ccf51b32cfa2d124aba8cff8f1727d35, type: 3}
  m_Name: HRQ_15
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HRQuizQSO
  _question: Jared got you with the 'You got something on your shirt' prank, and
    now everyone is laughing. What do you do?
  _inverseQuestion: Jared got you with the 'You got something on your shirt' prank,
    and now everyone is laughing. What do you <color=red>not</color> do?
  _answerRight: Laugh with them but remind them that pranks are not permitted during
    work hours.
  _answerWrong: That's the last time he pulls some s*** like this and gets away with
    it. Open a portal to the 5th realm under his desk.
